Here is a short overview. It's a plain answer with one view.

```openui-lang
# The root comes first.
root = Card([intro, steps, actions]) // the chat root
intro = TextContent("Three steps to **brew** coffee:")
steps = Steps([StepsItem("Grind", "Medium-fine, 18 g."), StepsItem("Bloom", "40 g water, wait 30 s."), StepsItem("Pour", "Slowly to 300 g.")])
actions = Buttons([Button("More tips", Action([@ToAssistant("Give me more coffee tips")]), "secondary"), Button("Buy beans", Action([@OpenUrl("https://example.com/beans")]), "tertiary")])
```

Enjoy your coffee.
